sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: fleet maintenance redesign 2026-11-03 (one Tools phase shared with node:converge). DECISIONS R1 (record-only change starts no run). docs/reference/tools.md#remove-a-tool.
  %% status: draft
  %% command: tool:remove
  %% kind: tool.remove
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Node 12<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: tool:remove 31
  %%> Command:
  %%> - `orbit tool:remove 31 --yes`
  %%> - syntax: `<tool> [--yes] [--idempotency-key=KEY] [--json]`
  Note over GW: Validate, lock the Tool<br/>task #5135 · ripgrep on Node 12
  alt package belongs to a role
    Note over GW: Delete only the record<br/>no run, package stays
    %%> Why:
    %%> - the recipe owns the package; removing it would break the role
    GW-->>CLI: Tool removed<br/>package kept for the role
  else Orbit installed it
    GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-tool-write
    GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5135
    SW->>SW: Write the playbook input<br/>inventory · vars · known_hosts
    SW->>N: Remove the Tool<br/>ansible · tags tools · absent
    %%> Why the converge phase:
    %%> - the same phase with this Tool marked absent; it removes the apt source too when no other Tool uses it
    %%> - a removal that would also remove a held recipe package is refused
    SW->>N: Check the Tool<br/>ansible · tags check
    alt check passes
      SW-->>GW: Run succeeded
      Note over GW: Delete the Tool record
    else the removal fails
      SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
      Note over GW: Mark the Tool failed
      %%> Retry:
      %%> - run the same command again after a fix
    end
    loop every 2 s until terminal
      CLI->>GW: operation:show #5135
      GW-->>CLI: status + result
    end
  end
